    don't attempt to purge `modules/pending` if the module updater is disabled anyway
    
    if `checkModules()` is never run, there's no point in precreating the dir.
    fixes installation on readonly filesystems (bwrap from nixpkgs, flatpak, ...)

diff --git a/src/updater/moduleUpdater.js b/src/updater/moduleUpdater.js
